ouse-drag slice.","src","/GameMap/media/learning/fruit-ninja-dojo-astra.webp","alt","Zen mode with split fruit, a visible slicing trail, score 8 and a four-hit combo.","https://fruit-ninja-dojo-20260905.yongqixue666.chatgpt.site/","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","GameMap browser capture","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型","items",[86],"其他 / 未指定代理","links","创作者开发记录",[92],"evidence","section",{"_61":93,"_25":94,"_95":96},"查看作者的模型使用与源码说明","https://linux.do/t/topic/2857340","note","The same forum author links the hosted game and subsequently the GitHub repository. The post names Astra and publishes the initial request; the client is not explicitly identified.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[101],{"_61":102,"_25":103,"_95":104},"查看完整游戏项目","https://github.com/yongqixue99-hue/fruit-ninja-dojo","Complete standalone index.html plus modular source, deterministic tests and build script. Canvas drawing and synthesized audio need no external runtime assets. Open index.html offline; development/test commands require Node.js 18+. No explicit code license was observed.","获取方式","playable","demo","试玩与运行",[110],{"_61":111,"_25":74,"_95":112},"试玩 Fruit Ninja Dojo","Chinese interface; hold and drag the mouse or swipe to slice. Space pauses/resumes, Esc closes dialogs, and M toggles audio. No login or installation.","游戏平台","浏览器","指南形式","disclosure","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[120],{"_61":121,"_25":94,"_95":-7},"阅读作者最初的 Astra 开发帖","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[126,127,128,129],"Choose Zen mode and slice a group of fruit.","Read the author’s original post and source-sharing follow-up.","Inspect gesture sampling, fixed-step physics and procedural fruit drawing.","Change one scoring or spawn rule and test pause, retry and saved records.","AI 工作流与开发背景","Laplace9 表示初版来自 Astra 极高推理强度的一句话请求，随后公开完整源码。当前仓库包含后续打磨与测试；初版的单轮生成说法不能证明现有每行代码都来自那次提示。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","2D","track","metadata","引擎","Canvas 2D · Vanilla JavaScript · HTML/CSS UI","engine","le